ique traits and mechanics. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in an analog horror experience featuring realistic graphics, a VHS 90s aesthetic, a dynamic camera system, and immersive flashlight movement.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You're trapped in an apartment with ever-changing rooms. Capture anomalies on camera, survive deadly entities and escape an endless nightmare.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Greek, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390880/c17744296d5575e79ac4f96ad86d3c3e76a67d4a/header.jpg?t=1778332368", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390880/ecf0dee16188eb31c38dda0b8ad4d28c0836fe80/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778332368", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390880/ecf0dee16188eb31c38dda0b8ad4d28c0836fe80/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778332368", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1070 Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD (Recommended), HDD (Supported)</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-6700K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® RTX 3070<br></li><